{
  "id": "DOC-19-Ta79bf",
  "title": "Text: DET Greg Garno ↔ Anthony Fenech",
  "date": "2019-03-19",
  "from": "DET Greg Garno",
  "to": "Anthony Fenech",
  "type": "text",
  "subjects": [],
  "content": [
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "11:52 AM",
      "text": "You hear about Fulmer?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:52 AM",
      "text": "No what"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:52 AM",
      "text": "Connecting in ATL"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "11:52 AM",
      "text": "Tommy John"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:52 AM",
      "text": "No fucking way"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "11:58 AM",
      "text": "We announce before the end of the game. But do me a solid and don’t run with this right this second because it’ll be pretty easy to trace back to me"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "11:58 AM",
      "text": "Ok......I called Al once. I’ll stop"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "11:59 AM",
      "text": "Thank you"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "11:59 AM",
      "text": "Lol I just keep thinking we could have Javy Baez at shortstop right now"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:00 PM",
      "text": "Before end of game?"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "12:00 PM",
      "text": "Yeah, whatever that means. PR is annoying"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "12:01 PM",
      "text": "It’s too serious to joke about but I can’t help but think “wonder what this means for the opening day starter”"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:01 PM",
      "text": "Omg lol"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:15 PM",
      "text": "Al called me back...he’s calling me again"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:15 PM",
      "text": "Lemme know how to proceed"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "12:15 PM",
      "text": "answer"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:15 PM",
      "text": "In a few minutes"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:22 PM",
      "text": "I’m Telling Kayla I don’t know"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:22 PM",
      "text": "[Attachment: Image]"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "12:23 PM",
      "text": "I’m sure she already knows I told you haha"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "12:23 PM",
      "text": "But that’s fine"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "12:23 PM",
      "text": "Make her believe I didn’t."
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:46 PM",
      "text": "I did"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:46 PM",
      "text": "Cuz now she won’t tell me lol"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:46 PM",
      "text": "[Attachment: Image]"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "12:46 PM",
      "text": "Lol"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:51 PM",
      "text": "When are they announcing"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:51 PM",
      "text": "She said just wait 5 min"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:51 PM",
      "text": "As if it’s soon"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "12:52 PM",
      "text": "Lol I haven’t been told anything about posting"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "12:54 PM",
      "text": "Ok, it’s coming soon."
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:55 PM",
      "text": "God damnit"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:55 PM",
      "text": "Al is gonna fuck me"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:55 PM",
      "text": "1 pm?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:55 PM",
      "text": "What’s the announcement say"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "12:56 PM",
      "text": "Approved: The following is an update from the Club on Michael Fulmer: Following a recent bullpen session, Tigers RHP Michael Fulmer began to experience right elbow soreness. Based on the results of an MRI, and after receiving a second opinion from Dr. James Andrews, Tommy John Surgery has been recommended in order to reconstruct the UCL. Fulmer is seeking a third opinion at this time."
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "12:56 PM",
      "text": "What time"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "12:56 PM",
      "text": "As soon as I get a graphic"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "1:02 PM",
      "text": "Going out soon"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "9:12 PM",
      "text": "You said I should take Wacha in my draft, right?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:12 PM",
      "text": "Yeah"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "9:22 PM",
      "text": "What do you think for catcher?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:23 PM",
      "text": "Hmmm"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:23 PM",
      "text": "What are your options"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:23 PM",
      "text": "In my auction league, I completely punted catcher"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "9:23 PM",
      "text": "It’s still early in the draft but only Gary and JT are gone"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:24 PM",
      "text": "I’d wait until you find a spot where Posey makes sense"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:24 PM",
      "text": "Grandal and Ramos aren’t bad either"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "9:24 PM",
      "text": "Yeah, was thinking about Grandal, but the playoffs scared me"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:25 PM",
      "text": "I just think I would wait as long as possible"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:25 PM",
      "text": "And get other depth, because at the end of the day there’s not a huge disparity imo"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "9:27 PM",
      "text": "Who you running out for relievers?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:37 PM",
      "text": "I got treinen"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:37 PM",
      "text": "Our lg is different, I’ll explain later"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:38 PM",
      "text": "10 starts per week"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:38 PM",
      "text": "So a guy like ryan Yarbrough, I got him"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:38 PM",
      "text": "He’s very valuable because he can pitch like 3-4 innings and get a win without using up a start"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:38 PM",
      "text": "Think Robertson has a good year in PHI"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:39 PM",
      "text": "Then you can get Siranithony Dominguez real late"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "9:39 PM",
      "text": "Cool, I literally just drafted him. Think he gets leaned on early before they would turn to Dominguez"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "9:39 PM",
      "text": "I have Baez, Correa and Goldschmidt in my infield but I need another 2nd/3rd baseman and they are in short supply"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:40 PM",
      "text": "Who’s left"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "9:41 PM",
      "text": "B Dozier, J Profar, Y Moancada, C Hernandez, R Devers, M Muncy, E Escobar"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:42 PM",
      "text": "Muncy, prob"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:42 PM",
      "text": "Daily lineups?"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "9:42 PM",
      "text": "yeah"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:42 PM",
      "text": "Profar has three position elig"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:42 PM",
      "text": "Love guys like that"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:42 PM",
      "text": "And he’s only 25 or 26"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "9:43 PM",
      "text": "Yeah, and he’s on Oakland so I like the chances he can be utilized well. Not in love with his OBP"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:43 PM",
      "text": "Has Adalberto Mondesi gone?"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "9:43 PM",
      "text": "Yeah, he went super high and I’m pissed. Thought I could steal"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:44 PM",
      "text": "He’s good"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:44 PM",
      "text": "Think Devers could break out, too"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "9:45 PM",
      "text": "Am I crazy to think Josh Harrison might be a value pick?"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:46 PM",
      "text": "Not entirely but it would have to be a deep league imo"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "9:47 PM",
      "text": "Asdrubel Cabrera is still available but IDK about him"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:48 PM",
      "text": "Disliked “Asdrubel Cabrera is still available but IDK about him”"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:48 PM",
      "text": "Those other guys have more upside"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "9:55 PM",
      "text": "I went Muncy and Moancada"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:55 PM",
      "text": "Liked “I went Muncy and Moancada”"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "9:56 PM",
      "text": "Moncada could break out i can’t touch him though because we penalize for K’s"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "9:56 PM",
      "text": "Ah, that makes a lot of sense. Figure this is either the year he puts it all together or flames out"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "10:22 PM",
      "text": "Welp, ended up with Shane Greene on my roster"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "10:38 PM",
      "text": "What’s your team"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "10:41 PM",
      "text": "[Attachment: Image]"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "10:41 PM",
      "text": "[Attachment: Image]"
    },
    {
      "from": "Fenech",
      "time": "10:42 PM",
      "text": "I like your offense"
    },
    {
      "from": "DET Greg Garno",
      "time": "10:43 PM",
      "text": "8 offensive categories and 7 pitching. Win all of one side and you win the week"
    }
  ]
}